<p class="eyebrow" data-copy-en="Character guide" data-copy-zh="角色攻略">Character guide</p>
<h1 data-copy-en="Willow" data-copy-zh="Willow">Willow</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Recruit the healer, improve training and collect ten medicine specimens." data-copy-zh="招募治疗人员，升级训练并收集十种药用标本。">Recruit the healer, improve training and collect ten medicine specimens.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">去哪里找</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">卡住时检查什么</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Meet_Willow_and_Collect_Glowcap_Mushrooms"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Recruitment_Conversations_in_Order"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Nature_Walk_and_Aether_Stone_Bonding"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Worker_#18_Setup_and_Training"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Worker_.2318_Setup_and_Training"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Two_Crafted_Training_Upgrades"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Shared_Home_Events"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Sirena_Isle_Daily_Activities"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="All29_Shared_Island_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Credits_and_Current_Scope"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Willow — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/willow.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Willow — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/willow.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Willow — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Willow begins as an alley discovery and can join Rose &amp; Thorn as a healer. Her three introductory heart-to-hearts lead to recruitment; the infirmary then offers crafted upgrades, Field Medicine and ten medicine-specimen hand-ins.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview_and_Schedule"></span><h2>Where to find them</h2><p>Explore Back Alleys until you meet her. She then appears at Secluded Sanctuary daily 06:00–17:59 and odd days 19:00–22:59. When active as a worker, her home portrait moves to the infirmary, daily 09:00–15:59; when inactive, she returns to the sanctuary.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>After meeting her, explore the alleys and collect Glowcap Mushrooms. Bring them to the sanctuary for Glowcap Mushroom Delivery. Finish it, reach Friend (100), then return on an odd evening for Dreams Under the Stars.</p><p>At 300 affection, after the second conversation and with Rose &amp; Thorn owned, start The Healing Partnership Proposal. Accept in its fourth exchange to recruit her. Declining leaves the proposal unfinished and available to retry. There is no fee, and recruitment does not build the infirmary.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Automatic scene</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Checkup</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Nurse's Room; 09:00–16:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Pepper Known (25); Known (25); home from vacation: Pepper / Willow; Pepper active as staff</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A Fair Supply</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Village Healer's Hut; 08:00–18:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Amelia Acknowledged (10); Friend (100); after The Healer's Hut; home from vacation: Willow; Willow active as staff</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Moonpetal Hands</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Cell Corridor</td><td data-label="Requirements">Bobo Friend (100); Friend (100)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Curious About Healing</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Nurse's Room</td><td data-label="Requirements">Blinky Acquaintance (50); home from vacation: Willow</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Glowcap Mushroom Delivery</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Secluded Sanctuary; Stranger (0); carry Glowcap Mushrooms; 06:00–17:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">60 min; 15 Energy; restores 10 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Dreams Under the Stars</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Secluded Sanctuary; Friend (100); after Glowcap Mushroom Delivery; odd days, 19:00–22:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">90 min; 20 Energy; restores 15 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Healing Partnership Proposal</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Secluded Sanctuary; affection 300; after Dreams Under the Stars; own Rose &amp; Thorn; 06:00–17:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">120 min; 25 Energy; restores 20 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr></tbody></table><p>At In Love (3,000), active and home at the infirmary, bring Void-Kissed Charm after Nature Walk with Willow for Permission to Live, or Golden Pulse Bracelet after the partnership for No Treatment Required. Each consumes the gift at 0 minutes, doubles matching training experience and adds 0.5 of base income, up to 2× with both.</p><p>At In Love, What Care Can Become offers +1 Field Medicine once per run at the infirmary. Owning Aether Stone also enables 60-minute bonding, once per day, for one stone level.</p></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Friendship_Actions_and_One-Time_Stat_Rewards"></span><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Willow</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Nurse's Room / Secluded Sanctuary; Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">10 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+1 base affection; 5/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Rare Ingredient</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Nurse's Room / Secluded Sanctuary; Known (25)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">10 min; 1 rare ingredients</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+5 base affection; 10/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Epic Ingredient</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Nurse's Room / Secluded Sanctuary; Known (25)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">10 min; 1 epic ingredients</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+10 base affection; 10/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Flowers to Willow</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Nurse's Room / Secluded Sanctuary; Known (25)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">10 min; 1 Flowers</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+5 base affection; 1/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Medical Ethics</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Nurse's Room; Known (25); Communication 60</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">40 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+12 direct affection; Mystic +1; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Walk in Nature</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Nurse's Room; Acquaintance (50); 09:00–13:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">120 min; 40 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Healing Philosophy</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Secluded Sanctuary; Known (25); Communication 20</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">30 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+8 direct affection; Intelligence +1; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Silvervein Moss</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Nurse's Room; Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">20 min; hand in 1 Silvervein Moss</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">Medicine +1; +10 base affection; one hand-in per specimen; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Hushbell Seeds</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Nurse's Room; Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">20 min; hand in 1 Hushbell Seeds</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">Medicine +1; +10 base affection; one hand-in per specimen; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Emberlace Root</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Nurse's Room; Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">20 min; hand in 1 Emberlace Root</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">Medicine +1; +10 base affection; one hand-in per specimen; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Cloudmilk Spores</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Nurse's Room; Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">20 min; hand in 1 Cloudmilk Spores</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">Medicine +1; +10 base affection; one hand-in per specimen; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Tideglass Kelp</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Nurse's Room; Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">20 min; hand in 1 Tideglass Kelp</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">Medicine +1; +10 base affection; one hand-in per specimen; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Velvetwake Buds</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Nurse's Room; Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">20 min; hand in 1 Velvetwake Buds</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">Medicine +1; +10 base affection; one hand-in per specimen; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Rainheart Cuttings</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Nurse's Room; Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">20 min; hand in 1 Rainheart Cuttings</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">Medicine +1; +10 base affection; one hand-in per specimen; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Stillthorn Sprig</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Nurse's Room; Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">20 min; hand in 1 Stillthorn Sprig</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">Medicine +1; +10 base affection; one hand-in per specimen; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Dawnthread Saffron</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Nurse's Room; Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">20 min; hand in 1 Dawnthread Saffron</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">Medicine +1; +10 base affection; one hand-in per specimen; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Memorymint Runners</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Nurse's Room; Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">20 min; hand in 1 Memorymint Runners</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">Medicine +1; +10 base affection; one hand-in per specimen; once</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Medicine specimens differ from ingredient gifts. At her active infirmary portrait, 09:00–15:59, each hand-in takes 20 minutes, consumes the specimen, raises Brothel Medicine by 1 and gives 10 base affection plus conversation-choice rewards. Each specimen is accepted once.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Specimen</th><th scope="col">Acquisition</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Emberlace Root</th><td data-label="Acquisition">Choose Recover Living Root at Haunted Mansion - Greenhouse: 15 minutes, guaranteed once.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Silvervein Moss</th><td data-label="Acquisition">Hike Mountains at Mountain Foothills (Uptown): independent 1% per completed activity.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Tideglass Kelp</th><td data-label="Acquisition">Scavenge at Surplus Distribution Center: independent 1%.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Cloudmilk Spores</th><td data-label="Acquisition">Explore Back Alleys in medieval Back Alleys: independent 1%.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Stillthorn Sprig</th><td data-label="Acquisition">Forage Ingredients at Royal Hunting Grounds (Edge): independent 1%.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Dawnthread Saffron</th><td data-label="Acquisition">Successfully escape a Noble Quarter heist after at least one completed theft: independent 1%.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Velvetwake Buds</th><td data-label="Acquisition">Defeat a Venus Flytrap in Dungeon or Infinity: base 0.01%, with applicable theft-item chance bonuses.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Hushbell Seeds</th><td data-label="Acquisition">Mary Ann, In Love and after The Butterfly Pavilion, Butterfly Pavilion on even days 10:00–16:59: Some Quiet to Grow, once, 20 minutes.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Memorymint Runners</th><td data-label="Acquisition">Terra, In Love and after What We Keep, Genetically Enhanced Plant Research Dome 06:00–17:59: A Familiar Scent, once, 20 minutes.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Rainheart Cuttings</th><td data-label="Acquisition">Audrey, In Love, active and home at the Brothel Garden 08:00–17:59: A Living Gift, once, 20 minutes.</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Held or delivered specimens cannot be acquired again. Ordinary loot modifiers do not improve the independent 1% activity rolls. On Sirena Isle she has Talk, Eat, Relax, Spa and Sunset, without solo Private Beach Time. Her Sunset has no extra NPC intimacy experience.</p><p>Her favorite stats are Creativity, Mystic, Charm. The learned Material Science skill improves her relationship bonus.</p><p>Start times are shown; the ending hour is excluded. Base affection receives the relationship bonuses, while direct affection is added as listed. Ordinary affection, player Erotic Experience and NPC intimacy experience are separate.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Kupie,_Gallery_and_Troubleshooting"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Kupie.2C_Gallery_and_Troubleshooting"></span><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><ul><li>Meeting Willow and finding mushrooms are separate alley results. Collect the mushrooms when offered.</li><li>Share Dreams needs Friend, the completed mushroom conversation and an odd day 19:00–22:59.</li><li>For recruitment check 300 affection, business ownership and acceptance in the proposal; declining does not complete it.</li><li>If absent from the sanctuary, check the infirmary, active status and vacation.</li><li>Hand-ins need the exact key item and her active infirmary portrait. Ordinary ingredient gifts do not substitute.</li><li>Complete the specified activity or battle for rare specimens; unrelated searches do not roll them.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-brothel.html">Infirmary and training</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-blacksmith-and-forge.html">Crafted gifts</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-soul-stones.html">Aether Stone</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-thieves-guild.html">Heists and theft items</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-dungeon.html">Dungeon</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-sirena-isle-resort.html">Resort activities</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Meet_Willow_and_Collect_Glowcap_Mushrooms"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Recruitment_Conversations_in_Order"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Nature_Walk_and_Aether_Stone_Bonding"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Worker_#18_Setup_and_Training"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Worker_.2318_Setup_and_Training"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Two_Crafted_Training_Upgrades"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Shared_Home_Events"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Sirena_Isle_Daily_Activities"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-All29_Shared_Island_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Credits_and_Current_Scope"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Willow 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/willow.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Willow 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/willow.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Willow 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Willow可在后巷首次遇见，之后能加入玫瑰与荆棘担任治疗人员。前三次交心对话通往招募；护士室还提供礼物升级、战地医疗课程及十种药用标本交付。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview_and_Schedule"></span><h2>去哪里找</h2><p>探索后巷直到遇见她。之后每天06:00—17:59及单数日19:00—22:59可在隐秘圣所见面。成为已启用员工后，头像改到护士室，每天09:00—15:59出现；停用时返回圣所。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>初见后继续探索后巷，取得荧帽蘑菇，带到圣所进行荧帽蘑菇递送。完成并达到朋友（100）后，于单数日晚上进行星空下的梦想。</p><p>300好感、完成第二次对话且拥有玫瑰与荆棘后，可开始合办诊所的提议，在第四轮接受即可招募。拒绝后仍未完成，之后可以重试。招募不收费，也不自动建造护士室。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">自动事件</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">检查</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">护士室; 09:00–16:59</td><td data-label="条件">Pepper 已知（25）；已知（25）；已结束度假：Pepper / Willow；Pepper已启用为员工</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">公道的供给</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">村庄治疗师小屋; 08:00–18:59</td><td data-label="条件">Amelia 已遇见（10）；朋友（100）；完成：治疗师的小屋；已结束度假：Willow；Willow已启用为员工</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">月瓣之手</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">牢房走廊</td><td data-label="条件">Bobo 朋友（100）；朋友（100）</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">对治愈的好奇</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">护士室</td><td data-label="条件">Blinky 相识（50）；已结束度假：Willow</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">荧帽蘑菇递送（菜单：荧帽蘑菇）</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">隐秘圣所；陌生人（0）；持有荧帽蘑菇；06:00–17:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">60分钟；15精力；恢复10镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">星空下的梦想（菜单：分享梦想）</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">隐秘圣所；朋友（100）；完成：荧帽蘑菇递送；单数日，19:00–22:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">90分钟；20精力；恢复15镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">合办诊所的提议（菜单：合办诊所）</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">隐秘圣所；好感300；完成：星空下的梦想；拥有玫瑰与荆棘；06:00–17:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">120分钟；25精力；恢复20镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr></tbody></table><p>恋爱中（3,000）、已启用且回到护士室后，可交付两种礼物：完成和 Willow 林间漫步后，用虚吻护符触发允许自己好好活着；合作提议后，用金脉手镯触发无需治疗。每项消耗礼物，不消耗时间，使对应训练经验翻倍，并增加基础收入的0.5倍，两项合计2倍。</p><p>恋爱中时还可在护士室进行关怀带来的成长，本轮仅一次，战地医疗+1。持有以太之石后，可每天花60分钟建立一次羁绊，使石头提升1级。</p></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Friendship_Actions_and_One-Time_Stat_Rewards"></span><h2>行动与奖励</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">和 Willow 交谈</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">护士室 / 隐秘圣所；陌生人（0）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">10分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+1；每天5次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送稀有食材</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">护士室 / 隐秘圣所；已知（25）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">10分钟；稀有食材×1</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+5；每天10次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送史诗食材</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">护士室 / 隐秘圣所；已知（25）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">10分钟；史诗食材×1</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+10；每天10次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送鲜花给Willow</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">护士室 / 隐秘圣所；已知（25）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">10分钟；鲜花×1</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+5；每天1次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">医疗伦理</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">护士室；已知（25）；沟通60</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">40分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">直接好感+12；神秘+1；仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">自然漫步</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">护士室；相识（50）；09:00–13:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">120分钟；40精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">行医理念</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">隐秘圣所；已知（25）；沟通20</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">30分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">直接好感+8；智力+1；仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">银脉苔藓</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">护士室；陌生人（0）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">20分钟；交付银脉苔藓×1</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">青楼药品等级+1；基础好感+10；每种标本仅交付一次；仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">静铃花种子</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">护士室；陌生人（0）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">20分钟；交付静铃花种子×1</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">青楼药品等级+1；基础好感+10；每种标本仅交付一次；仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">炽纹根</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">护士室；陌生人（0）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">20分钟；交付炽纹根×1</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">青楼药品等级+1；基础好感+10；每种标本仅交付一次；仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">云乳菌孢子</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">护士室；陌生人（0）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">20分钟；交付云乳菌孢子×1</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">青楼药品等级+1；基础好感+10；每种标本仅交付一次；仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">潮镜海带</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">护士室；陌生人（0）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">20分钟；交付潮镜海带×1</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">青楼药品等级+1；基础好感+10；每种标本仅交付一次；仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">绒醒花苞</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">护士室；陌生人（0）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">20分钟；交付绒醒花苞×1</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">青楼药品等级+1；基础好感+10；每种标本仅交付一次；仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">雨心插条</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">护士室；陌生人（0）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">20分钟；交付雨心插条×1</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">青楼药品等级+1；基础好感+10；每种标本仅交付一次；仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">静棘嫩枝</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">护士室；陌生人（0）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">20分钟；交付静棘嫩枝×1</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">青楼药品等级+1；基础好感+10；每种标本仅交付一次；仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">晨丝番红花</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">护士室；陌生人（0）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">20分钟；交付晨丝番红花×1</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">青楼药品等级+1；基础好感+10；每种标本仅交付一次；仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">忆薄荷匍匐茎</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">护士室；陌生人（0）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">20分钟；交付忆薄荷匍匐茎×1</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">青楼药品等级+1；基础好感+10；每种标本仅交付一次；仅一次</td></tr></tbody></table><p>药用标本与普通食材礼物分开。Willow已启用时，于09:00—15:59在护士室交付；每次20分钟，消耗标本，使青楼药品等级+1，并给予10基础好感及对话选项奖励。每种只收一次。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">标本</th><th scope="col">获取方式</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">炽纹根</th><td data-label="获取方式">在闹鬼豪宅 - 温室选择抢救活根，15分钟，首次必得。</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">银脉苔藓</th><td data-label="获取方式">在山脚（上城区）完成山中徒步，每次独立1%概率。</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">潮镜海带</th><td data-label="获取方式">在剩余物资分配中心完成搜刮，独立1%概率。</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">云乳菌孢子</th><td data-label="获取方式">完成中世纪的探索后巷，独立1%概率。</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">静棘嫩枝</th><td data-label="获取方式">在皇家狩猎场（边缘）进行采集食材，独立1%概率。</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">晨丝番红花</th><td data-label="获取方式">在贵族区至少完成一次偷窃并成功逃离，独立1%概率。</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">绒醒花苞</th><td data-label="获取方式">在地下城或无限地下城击败捕蝇草，基础概率0.01%，适用的盗窃物品概率加成另算。</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">静铃花种子</th><td data-label="获取方式">Mary Ann为恋爱中，完成蝴蝶馆后，双数日10:00—16:59到蝴蝶馆选择让宁静萌芽，仅一次，20分钟。</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">忆薄荷匍匐茎</th><td data-label="获取方式">Terra为恋爱中，完成我们留下的事物后，06:00—17:59到基因强化植物研究穹顶选择熟悉的香气，仅一次，20分钟。</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">雨心插条</th><td data-label="获取方式">Audrey为恋爱中、已启用且在家时，08:00—17:59到青楼花园选择一份鲜活的礼物，仅一次，20分钟。</td></tr></tbody></table><p>持有或已经交付的标本不能再次取得。普通掉落加成不会提高独立1%的活动概率。她在塞壬岛可交谈、用餐、放松、水疗和看日落，没有单人海滩私密时光；日落也不额外给予NPC亲密经验。</p><p>她偏好的属性为创造力、神秘、魅力。学会材料科学可提高关系加成。</p><p>表中均为开始时间，不包含结束整点。基础好感受关系加成影响，直接好感按所列数值增加。普通好感、玩家情趣经验和NPC亲密经验分别计算。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Kupie,_Gallery_and_Troubleshooting"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Kupie.2C_Gallery_and_Troubleshooting"></span><h2>卡住时检查什么</h2><ul><li>初次见面与寻找蘑菇是不同的后巷结果，遇到蘑菇后要实际拾取。</li><li>星空下的梦想要求朋友、蘑菇对话完成，以及单数日19:00—22:59。</li><li>招募需300好感、拥有青楼并接受提议；拒绝不算完成。</li><li>圣所找不到她时，检查护士室、启用状态与度假。</li><li>标本交付需指定关键物品及已启用的护士室头像，普通食材礼物不能代替。</li><li>稀有标本只在指定活动或战斗后抽取，重复其他搜索无效。</li></ul></section>
<section id="zh-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Related_Pages"></span><h2>相关指南</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-brothel.html">护士室与训练</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-blacksmith-and-forge.html">锻造礼物</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-soul-stones.html">以太之石</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-thieves-guild.html">盗窃与相关物品</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-dungeon.html">地下城</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-sirena-isle-resort.html">度假村活动</a></li></ul></section>
